    {
      "source": "If not specified, and if the <code>Container</code> instance is available, the\n<code>repository</code> part of the\n<code>docker image name</code> will be used. Note that\n<code>Container</code> instances are <em>not</em> available early enough when the\ncontainer is defined as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a> method. All\n<a href=\"ServiceConnection.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@ServiceConnection</code></a> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a> methods that need\nto match on the connection name <em>must</em> declare this attribute.",
      "translation": "如果未指定且<code>Container</code>实例可用，则使用<code>docker image name</code>的<code>repository</code>部分。请注意，当容器在<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a>方法中定义时，<code>Container</code>实例在容器定义时还早不可用。所有需要在连接名称上进行匹配的<a href=\"ServiceConnection.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@ServiceConnection</code></a><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Bean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a>方法<em>必须</em>声明此属性。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the name of the service",
      "translation": "服务名称",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the underling connection supports SSL, the <a href=\"PemKeyStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@PemKeyStore</code></a>,\n<a href=\"PemTrustStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@PemTrustStore</code></a>, <a href=\"JksKeyStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@JksKeyStore</code></a>,\n<a href=\"JksTrustStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@JksTrustStore</code></a>, <a href=\"Ssl.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@Ssl</code></a> annotations may be used to\nprovide additional configuration.",
      "translation": "如果底层连接支持 SSL，可以使用 `<a href=\"PemKeyStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@PemKeyStore</code></a>`、<a href=\"PemTrustStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@PemTrustStore</code></a>、<a href=\"JksKeyStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@JksKeyStore</code></a>、<a href=\"JksTrustStore.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@JksTrustStore</code></a> 和 <a href=\"Ssl.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection\"><code>@Ssl</code></a> 注解来提供额外的配置。",
      "count": 2
